# ── Code generation (R-B7, R-B12) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
FLUTTER_RUST_BRIDGE_VERSION="1.80.1" # bridge.yml; built with --features "uuid" --locked → generated_bridge.dart / bridge_generated.rs

# ── Native deps via vcpkg overrides (§3.2; overlay ports in ./res/vcpkg) ───────
# R-R2b: the hardware-codec natives (ffmpeg + mfx-dispatch) and their hwaccel
# override pins (ffnvcodec, amd-amf) are PRUNED from vcpkg.json (CPU-only software
# codec, Appendix C #2b); they were also the multi-hour build that made the §12.2
# Windows VM build infeasible. scripts/verify.sh gates their absence.
# Overlay ports (patched, in res/vcpkg): libvpx libyuv opus
# Native set built from baseline: libvpx libyuv opus libjpeg-turbo oboe
#   cpu-features. Crypto is the sodiumoxide crate, NOT vcpkg.

# ── vcpkg overlay distfiles — source and patch pins (R-B12(a)) ────────────────
# libvpx retains the v1.15.2 source archive and applies the exact upstream
# d5f35ac8 security patch. Both byte streams are SHA512-pinned and captured by
# online-fetch; every target consumes that capture through a file://-only port.
LIBVPX_SOURCE_REF="v1.15.2"
SHA512_LIBVPX_SOURCE="824fe8719e4115ec359ae0642f5e1cea051d458f09eb8c24d60858cf082f66e411215e23228173ab154044bafbdfbb2d93b589bb726f55b233939b91f928aae0"
LIBVPX_FIX_COMMIT="d5f35ac8d93cba7f7a3f7ddb8f9dc8bd28f785e1"
SHA512_LIBVPX_PATCH="2980e0504e207047d55e6c98dcc55c2a3c06315b4ec04d59c42d786657e03ba0e1c73a0718ac6635990aac25fc642b204a1d56e13501ce2bd9625996ad0310d8"
SHA256_LIBVPX_WINDOWS_TOOLS_MANIFEST="c888ee51f816d8fb811ff5e62971b973449d0dadfef683d4cae83119f0e83a8e"
