# Debian x86_64 : triple x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu  | triplet x64-linux           | features flutter,unix-file-copy-paste
# Android aarch64: triple aarch64-linux-android     | triplet arm64-android       | features flutter
# Windows x86_64 : triple x86_64-pc-windows-msvc    | triplet x64-windows-static  | features flutter
# Controlled-only profile (R-R2b): viewer OFF; decode/hwcodec/vram/flutter OFF (CPU-only encode).

